        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "此处指奠孟。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book033-b001584-p000-9c8f120f75",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "上格龙脉主年少中状元，官职接近君王；中格龙脉主兄弟同科及第，父子同朝为官。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book033-b001585-p000-8d7c18bafb",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "奠杯的形状，横过来的是奠孟。无论有盘或无盘，无论开启或闭合，都称为奠孟。品字形本为吉利，如果呈品字形且开启、展开、铺陈，则更为吉利。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book033-b001587-p000-ac7c2a8162",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "上砂龙脉主富贵双全；中格龙脉主小富，或收养他人之子；下贱龙脉主堕胎、患眼疾或出家为僧道。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
